OL,3,GNEWSAMore parking for Worcestershire
OL,4,AParkway sought
OL,5,
OL,6,FSince the station opened in 2020 it has
OL,7,Fsucceeded expectations, with about half
OL,8,Fa million passenger trips being made
OL,9,Ffrom its platforms annually.
